@DisplayName("出生继承：两个父批次各自隔离后合并，子批次出生即携带两个来源的并集")
void childBornWithUnionOfParentSources() {
    String a = unique("A");
    String b = unique("B");
    String c = unique("C");
    service.createLot(lotReq(a, "KG", "10"));
    service.createLot(lotReq(b, "KG", "10"));
